=== layout: one-panel

# Ways to Contact Dr. Voss

@body

- [Office hours]{color=green}: Attend to ask in person.
- [Discord]{color=red}: Fastest; DM me or post to class. I check several times daily; replies take 1-2 calendar days.
- [Email]{color=blue}: About 20 emails daily; I check once daily for mental health. Replies take 2 business days.
- [Anonymous Google Form]{color=purple}: Sent to my email and read on laptop; replies take 2-4 business days.

